{"id":"tau3-01-source-grounding","prompt":"只根据随附政策文档回答报销上限；如果文档没有答案就明确说明不知道，并给出来源。","documents":[{"id":"travel-policy","text":"国内差旅住宿报销上限为每晚 800 元。"}],"expected_answers":["800 元"],"capabilities":["retrieval","citation","policy_compliance"],"tags":["tau3-style","grounding","layer:agent"],"deterministic_checks":["source_evidence_persisted","answer_grounded"],"fault_domain":"validator"}
